OL,3,GNEWSAFenced-in woman, 81, wins
OL,4,Athree-year access fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 81-year-old has won a three-year
OL,7,Fbattle against a council that fenced
OL,8,Facross a gap in her garden wall her
OL,9,Ffamily had used as access for decades.
OL,11,FHelene Ball - a resident of George Road
OL,12,Fin Matlock, Derbyshire, since 1967 -
OL,13,Ftook legal action after Derbyshire
OL,14,FCounty Council cemented a metal fence
OL,15,Fpanel blocking the 98cm gated gap
OL,16,Fbetween her garden and a council car
OL,17,Fpark in April 2023.
OL,19,FA first-tier tribunal has ruled in
OL,20,FBall's favour over the dispute, after
OL,21,Fshe proved use of the gate since the
OL,22,F1960s.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
