OL,3,GNEWSAFenced-in woman, 81, wins
OL,4,Athree-year access fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA right of way has now been
OL,7,Festablished, while the council has been
OL,8,Fordered by the courts to pay #50,000
OL,9,Fcosts and to ensure her access is not
OL,10,Fimpeded again.
